“It’s time to become a multi-brand bank, because privately we’ve been exploring how to better serve our customers.”
If three years ago we aspired to be a big bank with a lot of brands, it would be taunted.
At the moment we are focusing on the needs of our customers, and I’m sure you’ve taken note of these changes.
“I think we can restart these brands, and the time is right now.”
