However, the illegal facts of these cases, the legal basis and the handling of penalties will be published, and the basic information of the illegal parties and the responsible persons of the relevant intermediary institutions will also be included in the "black list".
The government departments such as quality inspection, finance and customs have also taken relevant disciplinary measures for "blacklisted" parties.
The credit repair mechanism is an important milestone in the construction of the tax credit system and even the construction of the entire social credit system, which marks that China's social credit system construction is constantly developing and improving and becoming more and more immature."
"Environmental problems are reflected in the atmosphere, water and soil pollution, but the roots are still in production and lifestyle."
