To solidly promote the protection and governance of the ecological environment, it is necessary to fundamentally promote the transformation of production and lifestyle, and promote the transformation of people's livelihood with the construction of ecological civilization.
On the 11th, at Lianyungang port terminal, 42 wind turbine blades produced by Guodian Group were loaded and prepared for export to South Africa.
