Xiamen girl Zhang Binbin: "Beautiful hand shape" began to shoot the road of career several "reversal"
Just a few days ago, Zhang Donghong of Dongyuan Village in Xiang'an District of Xiamen replaced the 29-inch old TV in his home with a 65-inch TV.
The daughter of this ordinary farmer is Zhang Binbin, who won the silver medal in the women's 50-meter Rifle three-branch final for China on the evening of the 11th.
On the evening of the 11th, just in front of this new TV, Zhang Donghong and dozens of relatives and friends witnessed the magical process of their daughter catching up all the way, from the almost preliminaries were eliminated to the almost big reversal of the magical process.
In that day's competition, Zhang Binbin once ranked in the middle and lower reaches, it seems to be very far away from the final.
But the parents and friends did not give up, constantly swiping the text of the live broadcast, to see as the other players finished the game, Zhang Binbin all the way up, and finally locked the final seat, his home suddenly erupted from a cheer.
In the finals, Zhang Binbin was at the bottom of the ranking, the last few shots were more and more stable, and he only won the silver medal with 0.2 rings behind the champion.
The 27-year-old Zhang Binbin, in his 16-year-long shooting career, in fact, almost passed this hard-earned silver medal several times.
His mother, Zhang Xiaolong, told reporters that just when they hesitated, Zhang Binbin came up with a few "novel guests" in the same village.
These "novelers" were the children of the same village who were also recommended to participate in training at the same time, including Zhang Binbin's cousin.
Shortly after entering the Xiamen team, Zhang Binbin took the initiative to return to Xiang'an's school for reasons such as family difficulties.
However, after its Enlightenment coach Zhang Yajie repeatedly did his work, Zhang Binbin returned to the Xiamen team.
After entering the provincial team, Zhang Bingbin once returned home again because he could not enter the national team because he could not see hope.
This time, not only coach Zhang Yajie, the leaders and coaches of the Xiamen shooting archery sports center and the Fujian provincial team came to their homes and finally persuaded Zhang Binbin to return to the provincial team.
Just like yesterday's game, the Xiamen girl's insistence to achieve a reversal on the road of shooting.
"The way each coach chooses the players is not the same, at that time, I saw that Binbin's hand was very beautiful, and it fell in love at once."
Zhang Donghong also recalled that in the training test, although her daughter's performance was not the best, the number of rings played was very stable, which was also an important reason for Zhang Binbin to attract the coach.
In the process of training Zhang Binbin, Zhang Yajie's biggest impression was the input of the farm girl.
He recalled that more than a year after Zhang Binbin entered the Xiamen shooting team, there was a long-lasting shooting training in the team, requiring the players to be unable to move for half an hour.
Zhang Xiaolong told reporters that his daughter has always been a quiet and well-behaved child, who has loved to draw and homemade handmade toys since childhood.
"It turns out that I will make clothes at home and sew and make up, and I'll pick up some scraps and make my own dolls."
She said that her daughter often sewed handmade toys by herself, plus she was good at painting, from the doll's quintessences to clothing, can always be lifelike.
As an athlete, Zhang Binbin and his family gathered more and more, only holidays to go home, usually rely on the phone to contact.
The parents said that whether it is to meet or make a phone call, Zhang Binbin rarely talks about his own hard work, and it's more to talk to his parents about happy things.
I don't usually see my daughter's daughter at home, and my parents are careful to store her daughter's childhood paintings and honors over the years.
Zhang Xiaolong showed his daughter's anime paintings to the reporter, "If she hadn't been a shooting athlete, she should continue to paint."
On the 2nd floor of Zhang Binbin's living room, there is a cabinet full of medals, medals and certificates she has received.
Zhang Donghong placed the medals and medals neatly, and the certificates were uniformly placed in the folder to save, "These are the honors of Binbin for more than ten years, and we all cherish it."
Recently, the Hebei Cixiao Foundation sent 16,000 yuan of condolence funds to the hands of six lost family families in the villages such as Jingxing County, Taitou and Guiquan.
This is another condolence and caring action after the fund sent a message to the community to find "lost children and lonely elderly in the 7.19 floods".
7.19 The heavy rainfall affected many places in Hebei Province, resulting in floods in some parts of the province, and the death and disappearance of people.
The "old iron" of the "old iron" of the good people was unfortunately sacrificed to help the community's compulsory drainage, leaving two-year-old toddlers and the wife with Malacca, and the touching deeds of the good "old iron" touched the entire provincial city.
On August 4, Hebei Cixiao fund staff and Hebei Brand Association volunteers came to the "old iron" home of a good person and gave 3,200 yuan of love money into the hands of the "old iron" family.
Ye Li, vice president of the brand association, understood the current situation of the "old iron" family, and immediately decided to carry out the "love charity sale" activity among the corporate members of the brand association to help the "old iron" family to overcome the difficulties.
Hebei Cixiao Fund, known solely as Hebei Volunteer Service Foundation · Cixiao Fund, was initiated by the Hebei Brand Association Preparatory Committee and was established in August 2015.
According to Hong Kong's "Oriental Daily News" reported on August 12th, the current mainland diamond sales are alleged to have three major problems, including virtual standard diamond clarity to push up the price, virtual diamond weight, after-sales insecurity and so on.
Antwerp is one of the world's largest diamond trading centers, local artisan's diamond cutting technology is famous all over the world, and the diamonds sold have been rigorously authenticated and welcomed by mainland ladies.
"A small cloth bag, held in the palm of her hand, a small and fluttering, is worth nearly a million yuan," an aunt surnamed Liu, who was involved in the purchase of diamonds, described to the mainland media her experience in Antwerp in June this year.
She pointed out that she hid the diamond in her underwear, went to the toilet and bathed for a few consecutive days, and was very nervous to walk and sleep.
She claimed that the purchase price of the diamonds she bought in Antwerp was about 55,000 yuan per carat, and the retail price of the diamonds of the same quality in Xiamen was about 111,000 yuan.
A few days ago, with the purchase price plus 20%, she sold all the purchased diamonds and earned 200,000 yuan at a time.
According to the provisions of mainland customs, diamonds are non-passenger supplies or necessities in the itinerary, so they belong to the category of goods, they need to be declared at the time of entry and exit, otherwise they are listed for smuggling, and the situation can be seriously sentenced to imprisonment.
