According to foreign media reports, due to diving pool water from blue to green, the Rio Olympic "green pool" incident has recently attracted much attention from the outside world.
However, on the morning of the 10th, the water in the pool adjacent to the diving pool also turned green.
The Australian water polo player said after the game that his eyes were tingling and that he wanted to shed tears.
Earlier, the official personnel of the Rio Olympic Games confirmed that the pool's water became green, and said that the discoloration of the pool water was due to the weakening of alkalinity and did not affect the physical health of the athletes.
But the Australian athlete said his eyes were tingling after a win over a water polo pool with the Japanese team.
At the beginning, after the diving pool water became green, the game organizers worked overtime on the evening of the 9th to deal with the problem of the diving pool, but on the morning of the 10th it was found that the color of the pool also changed rapidly.
During the match between the Australian team and the Japanese team, the environmental conditions of the pool gradually deteriorated, but the official stressed that they will restore the water quality of the two swimming pools to their original color on the 11th.
Mario Andrada, a spokesman for the Rio Olympics, said: “Yesterday afternoon, the level of alkalinity of the water in the diving pool became weaker in the first place.”
"We learned about a number of factors that may trigger the discoloration of the pool water and the alkalinity of the water quality."
The Aquatics Center conducts a series of water quality tests, and hundreds of divers and swimmers have used the swimming pool to determine that the water quality conditions meet the standards.”
“We’ve been following normal procedures these days, but we’ve probably overlooked the more athletes that could have an impact on water quality.”
“But a change in the color of the water certainly has no effect on good health, especially for athletes.”
“This independent team confirmed our assessment and the steps we have taken to return the pool to normal colours and normal chemistry.”
“We had hoped that the swimming pool would return to its normal color in the morning, but the rate of recovery due to the rain was affected.”
According to Taiwan's "Central News Agency" report, an explosion occurred in a prison on the outskirts of the Greater Manila area last night, resulting in the death of the warden and the death of 10 prisoners, reportedly including two Chinese nationals.
ABS-CBN TV reported that the incident took place around 9 o’clock last night in Paranaque prison, but the police did not make a preliminary claim until 2 a.m. to this day.
According to the police, the 10 prisoners asked the warden to complain about the transfer, but the two sides did not speculate, and some of the prisoners threw grenades and caused the explosion.
Prison officials have not released the names of the dead prisoners, but GMA television reported that they included two Chinese nationals.
As of 8 a.m., there had been no detailed explanations, including on how the prisoners had acquired the grenade.
Yesterday, the police in the central part of the Philippines entered the regional prison in Leyte province and killed a person who "attempted to attack the police".
Urumqi to regulate the order of the tourist market operation travel agency must sign a contract with tourists
At present, Xinjiang has entered the peak tourism season, in order to standardize the operation order of the tourist market, the Urumqi Tourism Law Enforcement Detachment and the law enforcement detachment of the Municipal Transport and Administrative Bureau yesterday did not regulate the existence of tourist vehicles in the loose passenger market, travel agencies and tourists signed a low contract rate.
At eight o'clock in the morning, about 10 buses full of tourists were parked around the Kempinski Hotel, and most of these vehicles were scattered groups on a one-day trip to Tianchi.
“Hello, I’m from the Urumqi City Tourism Bureau, have you signed a contract with this travel agency?”
Urumqi Municipal Transportation Bureau law enforcement detachment staff Yu Bin introduced: "off-site tourist vehicles and train cars in the Urumqi market to operate tourist passenger transport projects, there is no qualification."
"Exceed the scope of business on this penalty of three to one hundred thousand fine, the driver does not have a qualification certificate is a fine of 2000 yuan."
It is understood that the tourism law enforcement department of Urumqi City has carried out an inspection of places such as western parks and Hongshan.
Combined with the two inspections, Ma Qi, the deputy leader of the tourism law enforcement detachment in Urumqi, said: "The first is safety, the second is the norm, there are no small things in tourist vehicles, and once the problem is the death of the group."
â€œWe jointly and continuously inspect the market, and regulate the behavior of travel agencies to ensure the safety of tourists.”
On the morning of August 12, the Information Office of the State Council held a press conference on the operation of the national economy in July 2016.
The spokesman of the National Bureau of Statistics and the director of the comprehensive statistics department of the national economy said that in July, the growth rate of some indicators of the national economy slowed down, but it was still operating within a reasonable range.
According to the data released by the National Bureau of Statistics, the growth rate of fixed asset investment and total imports fell in July.
Regarding the operation of the national economy in China in July, I would like to borrow a sentence that the Prime Minister used to say that "there is a fluctuation in shape, the situation is still good", which can better summarize the characteristics of economic operation in July.
He explained that the "volatile shape" means that the growth rate of some economic indicators in July has indeed declined.
Because the economy at home and abroad is still in deep adjustment in July, the international situation is complex and changeable, the recovery of the world economy is less than expected, so the export pressure is still relatively large.
Judging from the domestic situation, the entire economy is still at the critical stage of adjustment, the pain of adjustment is being released, and the economy is facing a lot of downward pressure, so there are some fluctuation in some indicators.
Sheng Laiyun pointed out that there is still a special situation in July, the floods are more serious, and the high-temperature and hot weather has brought some impact on the production and operation of some areas.
According to the situation recently released by the Ministry of Civil Affairs, more than 60 million people in the country have been affected, with direct economic losses of more than 200 billion yuan.
Judging from the relevant indicators of industry, investment and transportation, these areas are affected to varying degrees.
The growth rate of cargo weekly transit in July fell by 3.6 percentage points compared with the previous month, and the floods had a certain impact on traffic in these areas.
Judging from these factors, it is also very normal for some indicators to fluctuate in July, and it is also expected.
He said that "the trend is still good" means that although the economic growth rate has declined, the overall economic operation has been stable, and the general trend of steady progress and steady improvement has not changed.
In July, the CPI increased by 1.8% month-on-month and increased by 0.2% month-on-month; the CPI increased by 2.1% in January-July, so the price situation was generally stable.
According to the Chongqing Meteorological Bureau's high-temperature weather statistics of various districts and counties, in addition to Yanyang, the rest of our city can receive varying degrees of high-temperature allowances.
At present, there are at least 28 provinces in the country that have clarified the subsidy payment standards, but the standards issued by various provinces and cities are not the same, and Chongqing receives high-temperature subsidies in the form of high-temperature working-day subsidies.
Above 35 °C above 37 °C, according to the standard of not less than 10 yuan per person per day; more than 37 °C, per person per day is not less than 15 yuan.
High-temperature workers above 40 °C can receive a subsidy of up to 20 yuan/day per month (except for workers who already enjoy high-temperature job allowance in accordance with the law).
In accordance with this standard, last month's high-temperature weather for the largest number of high-temperature weather days in Kaizhou can receive 330 yuan, the lowest number of days in the city is 80 yuan, and the highest temperature in Yuyang because it does not meet the high temperature standard, so there is no high temperature allowance.
In the past, a large number of units will offset high-temperature allowances with refreshing drinks, and the Municipal Security Supervision Bureau said that this behavior is not in line with the current method.
Due to high-temperature weather to stop work and shorten the working hours, the employing unit shall not deduct or reduce the wages of the workers.
The Municipal Human Resources and Social Security Bureau said that if an employee encounters a high-temperature operation but does not receive a high-temperature allowance, they can fight for their legitimate rights and interests through the labor dispute mediation agency where the enterprise is located, or call 12333 to complain.
If a useful unit refuses to pay a high-temperature allowance, the worker may file a complaint with the competent human resources and social security department at or above the prefecture-by-county where the employee is employed.
At the same time, because the high-temperature allowance is a part of the salary and is not a benefit, it should be included in the total amount of wages and deduct taxes.
Therefore, the high-temperature allowance is not included in the scope of the minimum wage and must be paid in the form of cash and must not be substituted in kind such as drinks.
The newly built Urumqi station is located in the high-speed rail area of Urumqi, with an entire construction area of about 100,000 square meters.
The first and second floors on the ground are inbound, waiting rooms and office and commercial rooms, and the ground floor is the out-of-the-station floor.
At present, Urumqi Station is the largest comprehensive transportation hub in Xinjiang, integrating high-speed rail, rail transit, public transportation, and rental, which can seamlessly connect various transfer methods.
There are a total of 3 ticket halls on the north and south sides of the platform floor and on the north side of the out-of-the-station floor, equipped with 39 professional ticket windows and 34 vending ticketing machines.
In terms of tickets, there are a total of 30 lanes on the east and west sides of the waiting hall, and passengers can carry out rapid inspection and waiting according to the ticket gate number on the ticket.
If you need help, you can choose by pressing the 41 call buttons set in the nearby station to get timely service.
Since July 1, the old passenger station, the passenger train of Urumqi South Railway Station, has been walking to Urumqi Station.
In other words, all locomotives and 30 pairs of trains can be parked in Urumqi Station.
Now the two stations can buy tickets, the train time between them is about 10 minutes, and passengers need to pay attention to the specific station name of the ticket departure and the terminal.
Urumqi new passenger station officially put into operation will become an important platform for Xinjiang to build a national comprehensive transportation city, and promote the construction of the "Silk Road Economic Belt" and new zones.
Gracia is a budding female toucan that exudes tropical rainforest.
In the Central American country of Costa Rica, Toucan Gracia and its story are already well-known.
At a press conference on August 10, Gracia, who recovered after surgery, finally appeared to show people its brand-new 3D printed plastic beak.
The toucan, which had been snapped a year and a half ago and was moribund, has finally been reborn.
This day not only announces that it is 100% healthy, it is also the day that it has moved into a luxurious aviary to meet with human friends who care about it.
Gracie, who had entered his new home, was a little shy, but soon became lively, bouncing and frolicking in the basin and ate grapes with a new beak.
In order to remind people of the injuries it once suffered, the technicians did not color its new beak, but retained the original white of the 3D printed material.
Outside the beak, there is a thin angular sheath, which is hollow inside, with only a few fine bone support rods interlaced.
Although there is this internal reinforcement component, the toucan's beak is still fragile and will be broken when it is damaged.
Animal rescue centers, ornithologists and an American 3D printing company worked together to create several “experimental beaks” for Gracia, and finally the “perfect beaks” that work best for it.
Gracie is now proficient in using new beaks to drink water, eat, and even peck small grains.
“It took about two months to design the finished product, and it only took four or five hours to print.”
"3D printing is not the technology of the future, it has actually come into my life," Thomas Lange, chairman of SG3D printing in the United States, said in an interview with Xinhua International.
In January 2015, Gracia, a blood-covered toucan, was discovered on a farm in Gracia, in the central province of Alajuela in central Costa Rica.
At that time, its upper beak was cruelly broken by a group of young people, it was completely unable to eat, and his life was in danger.
Grecia's tragedy, reported in the media, has aroused a wave of anti-animal abuse inside and outside of Costa Rica.
Stricter animal protection laws have been proposed to increase the punishment of abusers.
People came spontaneously and did their best to help Gracia recover as much as he could before his injuries.
Even Chuck Hull, the inventor of 3D printing technology, was involved in Gracia’s beak design.
“The situation in Gracia is very special, with less than one centimetre remaining in its upper beak, which creates a lot of difficulty in installing a new beak.”
“We first scanned Gracia, then designed and produced an extended prosthesis that was slightly longer than the rest of the beak on it, and fixed it with viscose.”
“This will reduce further intrusive damage to Gracia,” Lange told Xinhua.
Prior to installing the prosthesis, the staff had to remove the beak for Gracia on a daily basis in case of infection.
Thousands of miles away, the Toucan’s story of Gracia touched renowned documentary filmmaker Paula Heredia and Discovery News Channel producer John Huffman.
They recorded bits and pieces during Gracia’s installation of a new beak and recorded a documentary, The Nation of Toucans, which aired this month on Animal Planet Channel.
The documentary Country of Toucans shows people how a small toucan makes a country to change it and how its citizens are involved in the fight against animal cruelty.
Japan's oil companies, in particular, are wary of the rise of China's small independent oil refineries known as "teapots".
Reference News Network reported on August 12 that Japan's largest oil company JX Energy believes that "China's expansion of exports is one of the reasons for the sluggish market."
Japanese oil companies, in particular, are wary of the rise of China’s small independent refiners, known as “teapots.”
The quality of China's petroleum products is gradually getting closer to Japan's oil products because the Chinese government's strengthening of environmental protection regulations.
Before obtaining the crude oil import license, "teapot refineries" generally imported heavy oil with high sulfur content from Russia and other places for refining.
The sulphur content of the petroleum products produced is high, and the oil is poor, which has become one of the reasons for environmental pollution.
After obtaining the crude oil import license, the "teapot refinery" was able to import Omani crude oil with low sulphur and Russian crude oil, and the quality of its petroleum products was also improved.
Dongming General Oil Company said: "With the continuous improvement of China's domestic petroleum product quality standards, the ability of refining equipment has also improved.
As a result, China’s exports of petroleum products have gradually reached the same level as those in Japan (the world’s highest quality).
"After the end of 2015, China began to export high-quality light oil to Australia and competed with Japanese products in the Asian market.
Although "Japanese high-grade oil" is facing a crisis, the response strategy adopted by Japan's oil companies is only to "pay attention to the market and exports to profitable regions at the same time."
Due to the huge impact of China's exports of petroleum products on the Asian market, there is also an increasing degree of attention to teapot refineries.
In 2016, the Yangtze Evening Evening Sunshine Student Assistance Initiative was launched on May 26, and after two months of registration, the total number of poor students applying for grants reached more than 800.
In the course of student assistance, more than 1.2 million yuan of social donations have been received (it has been publicized in five batches), which can help at least 240 cold-level students.
At present, donations are continuing, and this newspaper calls on the community to continue to lend a helping hand, so that more children with difficult families can receive financial support and social care.
In order to ensure the fairness, openness and transparency of student aid operations, this newspaper announced the basic information of the students in batches starting today, and today's 1,100 people will be publicized, which will be supervised by the readers.
Li Qun sunshine student-assistance action is a well-known charitable brand in China, and the Yangtze Evening Li Qun Sunshine Assistance Action has been carried out in Jiangsu since 2003, supporting more than 4000 poor students.
The scope of funding for this activity is the undergraduate admission of college entrance examination students, excluding tuition-free majors; excellent quality, family poverty.
New Zealand’s population growth had previously only been more than 2 per cent at the peak of the “baby boomers” in the 1974 and early 1950s to the early 1960s, according to the Bureau of Statistics.
As of June this year, New Zealand's net inflow of immigrants in the 12 months was 69,100, which has become the main driving force of New Zealand's population growth in recent years.
New Zealand’s natural population grew by 28,200 people over the same time period.
According to the data, in the past 10 years, New Zealand's average annual net inflow of immigrants has reached 21,800 people, and the average annual natural population has increased by 32,300 people.
In terms of population structure, the large influx of immigrants means that the proportion of the “working-age population” between the ages of 15 and 39 is gradually expanding.
During the 12-month period ending in June 2016, New Zealand’s working-age population grew by 3.6% to 1.58 million.
At the same time, the number of elderly people over the age of 65 also increased by 3.6%, reaching 700,000.
At about 10 a.m. yesterday, the X9003 international freight train left Xi'an's newly built station and went to Almaty, Kazakhstan.
The opening of the train marks that the Xi'an Railway Bureau has successfully exceeded 10000 vehicles since the opening of the Central Asian international freight train in 2013.
It is understood that the category of goods transported by the freight train covers six categories of industrial raw materials, mechanical equipment, industrial spare parts, building materials, food and light industrial products, with a total of 206 varieties.
As of August 11 of this year, a total of 221 Central Asian trains and 1,009 vehicles have been opened, with a total of 338,000 tons of exported goods, of which 84 were opened in 2016, an increase of 47% year-on-year.
It is understood that the goods carried by the Central Asian train for the first time are "made in Shaanxi", and now, it has attracted a large number of foreign sources.
As of the end of July, Central Asia's container volume exceeded 64,000 TEU, an increase of 8% compared with the same period in 2015.
With the opening of the Central Asian train, the freight volume of the newly built stations of the Xi'an Railway Bureau has increased year by year.
In 2015, the annual cargo throughput of the newly built stations was 2.477 million tons, and as of August 10, 2016, the volume of freight delivery had reached 1.531 million tons, an increase of 6.7% over the same period last year.
In order to meet the needs of future development, the Xi'an Railway Bureau's plan for the construction of Xi'an's new railway integrated logistics center centered on the newly built stations has been introduced, making every effort to build a modern new railway integrated logistics park.
An Indian uncle just last week at Dubai International Airport, where he won a $1 million jackpot at the same airport this week.
Mohammed Bashir Abdul Hedal, a long-time Indian living in Dubai, United Arab Emirates, is in the habit of buying lottery tickets every time he returns home.
His 21-year-old son was paralysed by an accidental fall when he was 13 days old, and he’s always worked hard to pay off his son’s medical loans.
“Escape from an air crash was God gave me a second life, and it gave me the money to do good deeds,” Hedar said.
Although it is now autumn, the power of "autumn tigers" does not seem to be worse than summer.
Ultraviolet rays not only make the skin of the students dark, but also bruise the skin, how to make the skin can pass the military training smoothly and not be sunburned?
Sunscreen packaging is generally marked with SPF and PA, SPF refers to the sun protection index, which is aimed at UVB ultraviolet rays, and our common SPF index is 15, 30, 50 and so on.
The product labeled PA is aimed at UVA, which will play a more effective role in sunscreen, under normal circumstances, the strength of the PA is represented by +, and an additional + means that the effective protection time is extended.
The oily skin should choose water-based sun protection products with strong permeability, and sunscreen spray is also a good choice.
Dry skin should choose frost-like sunscreen products; neutral skin is generally not strictly regulated, sensitive skin rubbing on any care products is a burden, it is recommended to choose pure physical sunscreen products.
Remember to apply the sunscreen half an hour in advance, because sunscreen products take time to completely seep into the skin.
Military training sunshine time for a long time, sunscreen every two hours to have a lasting effect, don't be lazy.
Because the skin has just been irritated by the sun, military training does not immediately use whitening products.
After the military training is exposed, if there is a condition, a towel can be wrapped in ice cubes to freeze the burned skin to slow down the local heat.
The farmers who purchase agricultural machinery during the exhibition will continue to implement the cumulative subsidy policy, and farmers can receive up to 40% of the subsidy for agricultural machinery.
This exhibition is aimed at the global investment exhibition, in particular, it has increased its invitations to countries and target market countries along the “Belt and Road”.
The exhibition strives to complete 60 investment signing projects, introducing funds of 22 billion yuan, signing more and more than 160 trade contracts and 3.2 billion yuan of contracts.
It is reported that the "Xiangbo Fair" has been settled in Loudi for seven consecutive years, due to the strong manufacturing industry base in Loudi City, Hunan Province, and its industrial development has a long history.
As the organizer of the "Xiangbo Expo", Loudi has established trade relations with more than 90 countries around the world.
The "Xiangbo Fair" has become an important platform for cultivating the development of characteristic industries and promoting characteristic industries to go abroad.
On some nights, the ionosphere is full of free electrons, which means radio signals can go even further.
According to the U.S. "Popular Science" monthly website reported on August 11, the U.S. Air Force is interested in replicating this effect.
While a oscillary layer with a stable abundance of free electrons can help people listen to it on the edge of a university radio station, that may not be of the interest of the U.S. Air Force.
The electronic ionosphere means that the radio used by the military has a larger range, and it may provide some protection for Global Positioning System (GPS) signals from the effects of solar storms.
The ultimate goal may be to build a series of CubeSats based on demand, which can strengthen the ionosphere when needed.
But first of all, the teams that have a contract with the Air Force have to prove that the relevant scientific principles will work.
According to industry data, the total scale of coal production capacity in 2015 was close to 6 billion tons, and the country's excess coal production capacity was 1.8 billion tons.
In the past ten years, the State Council has issued a total of five notices to eliminate excess and backward production capacity.
Although the first four times did not target the coal industry, the target industry has a direct relationship with the coal industry.
From November last year to January of this year, the price of Qinhuangdao's 5,500 kcal thermal coal has been hovering at 370 yuan / ton for a long time, and 90% of the coal companies have fallen into losses.
Since the beginning of February, coal prices have gradually rebounded, and the price of Qinhuangdao thermal coal has recently risen for four consecutive weeks, rising to a 16-month high, once climbing to 436 yuan per ton, an increase of nearly 70 yuan compared with the beginning of the year.
With the recovery of the price, people from all walks of life are worried: will a number of small coal mines resume production?
In this regard, Qiu Xianming, director of the Economic Institute of the China (Hainan) Reform and Development Research Institute, conducted an analysis and interpretation.
Qian Xianming: the production capacity has aroused the great concern of all parties, and today's announcement of the coal industry's capacity-to-production report also really makes everyone feel more worried.
These three surface factors still reflect the reason for the relatively lagging changes in our growth patterns in the past, that there has not been a fundamental change in the government-led mode of growth so far.
Second, it is also directly related to the promotion of local governments, in the process of production capacity, funds and corresponding supporting measures must be put in place, from this point of view, the difference between different regions is indeed relatively large.
Third, if some provinces, which are currently slow to catch up in the second half of the year, they may face greater risks.
In this case, relying on the central award and supplementary funds to promote the process of production capacity may have a certain negative impact.
First of all, to production capacity is not a simple way to control the total amount.
Our goal is to promote the optimization of the structure and reconstruct the new format of the entire coal industry through the elimination of backward production capacity.
In the process of deploying production capacity, local governments must combine the transformation and upgrading of production capacity and the coal industry, and vigorously develop related service industries.
Second, in order to complete this year's de-capacity tasks in this year, we still need to give full play to the power of administrative supervision and administrative supervision.
In the end, we must strengthen the role of social security.
Because the market is directly related to the problem of employment, we need to strengthen the employment skills training of employees and employees.
“The reason for the decline in the ranking is due to the deterioration of foreign capital’s expectations for Brazil’s GDP development in the medium term.”
In 2015, Brazil’s participation in global direct investment was 3.7%, down from 5.7% in 2014.
Credit Suisse’s international investment attractiveness index includes four sub-indices: infrastructure, economic prospects, the business environment, and direct investment volumes.
In 2015, international direct investment in Brazil was $64.6 billion, down from $73.1 billion in 2014.
Last year, “greenfield investment” in Brazil (investment in factories abroad) was $17.9 billion, a decrease of 2.1% year-on-year.
“There are 288 ‘greenfield investment’ projects in Brazil, up from an annual average of 314 between 2003 and 2014.
However, in the first half of 2016, foreign direct investment in Brazil had reached $33.8 billion, an increase of almost 10% compared to the same period last year.
Original title: Canadian police kill IS supporters: homemade bomb attack near the end
The taxi company said the taxi was dispatched to Dreyver’s home before police arrived.
Canadian police said at a news conference on Wednesday that they had received information from the U.S. Federal Bureau of Investigation on a "portrait of martyrdom" provided by the U.S. Federal Bureau of Investigation that the young man was about to carry out the attack.
According to DW, a man wearing a black Balaklafa hat was reading the Koran, mentioning crimes against Muslims and vowing that an attack on a city in Canada would soon be launched.
He said in the video that the attack will take place within 72 hours and during peak hours.
This is the first time since Canadian Prime Minister Justin Trudeau came to power last year that the police killed a terrorist suspect before the incident.
After the upgrading and renovation of the Beijing-Hangzhou Grand Canal feeder channel Old Wanfu River, the northern skating waterway will collect tolls on September 1.
These two tributary waterways adopt social financing to carry out renovation and construction, and the charges have been approved by the relevant departments of the provincial government.
The old Wanfu river channel flows through Jinxiang and Yutai, entering the main channel of the Beijing-Hangzhou Grand Canal through Nanyang Lake, with a total length of 32.5 kilometers.
According to the needs of navigation, the old Wanfu river waterway adopts the maintenance and transformation method, the local water depth is deep, and the local acute bends are bent and straight, etc., and the navigable conditions can be improved.
The channel flows through Jinxiang County and Rencheng District, and enters the main channel of the Beijing-Hangzhou Grand Canal through Nanyang Lake, with a total length of 19 kilometers.
The renovation project of the two waterways started construction in February 2011, and the acceptance was completed in January 2015, and the main body of investment construction and operation is Jining An Ping Canal Logistics Service Center.
In accordance with the principle of "loan construction, fee repayment", Jining An Ping Canal Logistics Service Center collects channel tolls according to the charging standards approved by the Shandong Provincial Price Bureau.
Among them, the basic toll is calculated according to 1.75 yuan / deadweight tonnage, and the mileage toll is calculated according to 0.05 yuan / km dwt.
The toll collection period runs from June 15, 2016 to June 14, 2019.
At present, there are a total of four toll channels in Jining, namely, the Shushui River channel, the Baima River channel, the northern yo-yo channel, and the old Wanfu river channel.
Each of the four shipping lanes is a tributary channel of the Beijing-Hangzhou Grand Canal, all of which have been upgraded in the form of social financing.
Upgrading and Upgrading of the Sushui River channel is the first to adopt the "government + market" model, which will be used for projects in the construction of inland and port aviation infrastructure in Shandong Province, with the government accounting for the main investment and supplementing the funding gap for social funds.
Branch channels such as the Baima River, the Old Wanfu River and the Beidailu River have adopted a purely market-oriented operation method.
The funds allocated by the national finance can not meet the needs of project construction, which restricts the progress of channel upgrading.
The use of social funds for the construction of public infrastructure meets the requirements of national policies, and has also become a way to crack the funding bottleneck.
Ning Zetao's performance in the 100-meter freestyle semi-finals has left many Chinese spectators speechless.
However, in the preliminaries of the 50-meter freestyle, Ning Zetao once again refreshed people's "bottom line".
In fact, the 50-meter freestyle is not Ning Zetao's main project, and his performance and best results in the Kazan world championships also determine that he is unlikely to make a breakthrough in this project.
Sure enough, Hong Kong's authoritative media "Grand Gazette" revealed that the biggest reason for Ning Zetao's defeat was that he had lost his interest in swimming.
There are many factors on the sidelines that may have a great influence on his ideas for the future, and he is now likely to be more interested in marching into the entertainment industry.
After the Kazan world championship, Ning Zetao, with his ultra-high face value and good results, instantly became a net red.
As a result, "national husband", "small fresh meat", "beautiful man" and other titles also continue to become his label.
All kinds of commercial activities come to the door, a beautiful way of money, to become a glittering avenue.
In this case, even if Ning Zetao chose to retire at this time to join the entertainment circle, it is not only his freedom, but also a seemingly feasible path.
After all, he is only 23 years old, after a certain amount of study, he can star in one or two TV series with his popularity.
However, Ning Zetao needs to see if he has enough qualifications compared with these predecessors?
At the 2000 Sydney Olympic Games, the 21-year-old Liu Xuan has reached the end of his career as an athlete.
The beautiful appearance of Liu Xuan made her quickly remembered by people, and also laid the foundation for her to enter the entertainment industry in the future.
After decommissioning, he starred in a number of TV dramas and set up his own studio in 2013.
Tian Liang participated in the single and double ten-meter platform competition of the two Olympic Games, and obtained 2 gold and 2 silver.
However, after the loss to teammate Hu Jia in the single ten-meter tournament at the 2004 Olympic Games, Tian Liang's competitive status declined, and he was expelled by the diving team.
While he and his daughter participated in variety shows such as "Daddy Go", it made him gain enough attention.
Yang Wei, Li Xiaopeng and Chen Yibing all participated in various variety shows.
It is worth mentioning that Yang Wei Li Xiaopeng at that time led China to win the 2008 Olympic men's team championship, and Yang Wei won the individual all-around gold medal twice, known as the all-around king.
At the same time that Chen Yibing led China to win the 2012 Olympic team championship, it has also become the hanging ring king.
After the London Olympic Games misjudgment loss of the gold medal, Chen Yibing's big move also made him countless fans.
However, the main energy of these athletes is still in the field, and the variety shows are just like a dragonflies - they will run away.
However, whether it is a retired or active athlete, it is necessary to be able to get the favor of the entertainment industry.
Athletes step into a new field after all, whether it’s their ability or their connections, it’s a blank state.
Even the "elderly people" such as Tian Liang and Liu Xuan, who have been involved in the entertainment industry for many years, the ordinary audience mentioned them, and they still think of their performance in the Olympic Games.
Yang Wei, Li Xiaopeng and other newcomers, in the Variety show appearance, without exception are "Olympic champions".
Compared with the above a few people, Ning Zetao's reputation as a swimming world champion is still slightly thin.
What's more, compared to Tian Liang, Liu Xuan, Yang Wei and other people's achievements and retreat, Ning Zetao if at the age of 23, a small setback in his sports career, the negative impact on its image may also be immeasurable.
After all, when it comes to athletes, people's requirements are "not looking for a hundred victories, but do not be afraid of danger", Ning Zetao is still far from this.
Ten thousand steps back said that Ning Zetao is handsome and can completely rely on face value to obtain the support of thousands of brain powders.
There is no skill, just rely on the appearance, want to mix well in the entertainment industry, which is no more difficult than a good training to get back its due state.
The choice of the road of life is all based on personal will, but in the end how to choose Ning Zetao's heart should be numbered.
On the surface, online social platforms have broadened their communicative circles and reduced people’s feelings of loneliness.
The sphere of influence of online socialization has become more and more extensive, not only gradually replacing traditional telephone contacts, but even infiltrating the real life circle offline, quietly changing the social life of the current people.
The advantages of online socialization are obvious, such as convenient and fast, so they are particularly favored by young people.
According to a survey of the social habits of college students, 57% of college students spend more than 5 hours a day using their mobile phones, and their daily life is basically "not out of hand".
"Social networks have the characteristics of low cost, fast transmission speed, and simultaneous communication of many people, which meets the needs of contemporary university students."
Expanding interpersonal circles, more equal dialogue, and avoiding social concerns are the main reasons why we love online conversation more and more.
The newcomers who have just entered the company love to communicate with their colleagues online, "because they are not familiar with the unit, through the likes and comments on the social platform, the relationship is much closer than before."
People who love friends also often use online communication, "before with friends because of some misunderstanding for a period of time did not contact, and then in a large group of first dialogue a few words and warm up."
IT engineer Wu Yan is an in-depth network social enthusiast, and most of his social life takes place online, and the number of network contacts is several times that of offline circle of friends.
Wu himself admitted that it is more "like a fish in water" on the Internet.
“You can reply to a friend when it is convenient for yourself, because there are a lot of time to consider the words, the expression can also be clearer.”
“Hidden under the ID, I always avoid face-to-face interpersonal collisions, not only have room for manoeuvre, and even give each other more time and space to think about words and deeds.”
“People of different identities have the same right and efficiency to speak, and real-life social concerns seem to be eliminated in cyberspace.”
However, Xiao Peng, a friend of Wu's speech, felt that Wu Yan in his life was a "quite boring house man."
Xiaopeng and Wu Yan met in a large group, because they were both active speakers, and they soon became familiar with each other.
Xiaopeng felt that Wu Yan and the network judged two people, the words are boring, do not take the initiative to express their opinions, over and over is a few words "huh, okay, is it", or "this I want to go to the Internet to check it."
Lingshui police have now intervened in the investigation, Lingshui traffic department will also increase efforts to rectify illegal operating vehicles.
“There was no investigation by the police in the clashes of 4 August, and at 0:00 hours on 11 August, two other drivers’ taxis were smashed in their accommodation again.”
At present, tricycles often operate illegally at night, and it is hoped that the competent authorities will also intensify their efforts to carry out rectification."
The South China Sea Network reporter learned from the Public Security Bureau of Lingshui Li Autonomous County that the police have now accepted the report of these two cases, and the causes of the two cases, who committed them, and whether they are related are under further investigation.
Wang Wenyi, director of the traffic management station of Lingshui Transportation Bureau, said that at the beginning of this year, the Lingshui Transportation Department began to remediate the illegal operation of passenger-carrying tricycles, and banned a total of 613 three-wheelers.
In the next step, the transportation department will apply to the county government to work with multiple departments to strengthen the rectification of illegal operating vehicles such as tricycles, motorcycles and black cars throughout the county.
At 8 a.m. on the morning of August 11th, Qilu Evening News reporter followed the "Healthy China trip" volunteer service team to Hegou Village, West Lake Town, Donggang District.
The village is located in remote, about 24 kilometers from the urban area, more than 200 households in the village, due to the limitations of economy, transportation and body, to many middle-aged and elderly patients to go out to see a doctor caused inconvenience.
The project is more comprehensive, internal medicine, surgery, respiratory medicine, psychiatry, dermatology and pediatrics.
A lot of villagers have heard that the experts of the clinic are coming, and they have been waiting in the small square in the village early.
The 67-year-old is suffering from congenital scoliosis, and in the past few years, she has been plagued by "asthma", so that she will be breathless and breathless when she walks the upper slope.
The doctor told Aunt Xue that it is unlikely that chronic bronchitis should be completely cured, and it can be alleviated by usually insisting on medication.
At the dermatologist’s office, a 60-year-old man came for advice with her grandson.
The old man's little grandson is 11 years old this year, starting from the child's 3 years old, the left foot has been plagued by "foot gas".
The doctor told the old man that this is not a "feet" but a seasonal eczema, don't delay the treatment.
"In this village, we provide medical treatment and B-ul-chao services, while the other team's volunteer service team in Qiujiadian Village in Wulian County also provides free medical examination services.
"This rural clinic is only one part of the "healthy China trip", in the next few days, other activities will continue to be carried out."
51Talk is regarded as a milestone in the construction of the online education industry ecosystem.
CEO Huang Jiajia said that bringing the world's best learning resources to China's children is their strategy for the next five years.
It is understood that the biggest advantage of 51Talk is to be able to meet the needs of users of different ages.
Zhang Liming, the chief operating officer, said that the world's high-quality foreign teacher funds and services are connected to the students, and parents no longer need to travel and take their precious time to transport their children.
The central bank renews payment business licenses for 27 non-banking institutions such as Alipay for 5 years
In order to integrate business resources, give effect to the scale effect, and improve regulatory efficiency, the renewal will adjust its business scope accordingly for the payment institutions that fit and the "payment business license".
Consolidated payment institutions should complete the payment business undertaking work within 6 months from the date of the announcement.
The People's Bank of China will deal with the cancellation and renewal of the relevant "payment business license" after the completion of the business undertaking work.
Due to the serious business violations of some payment institutions, the stagnation and contraction of the business, or the active application to terminate the type of business, the renewal has reduced its business scope.
The relevant institutions shall, within 6 months from the date of the announcement, stop carrying out the relevant payment business in an orderly manner as required.
The People's Bank of China will continue to carry out the renewal of the "payment business license" in accordance with the law.
A 4.4 and 4.5-magnitude earthquake in Nima County in Tibet has not yet caused casualties.
According to the report of the local civil affairs department, there have been no casualties at present, and the specific disaster situation is undergoing further statistical verification.
The vice chairman of the municipal disability federation attended the event and made an important speech.
Participating leaders jointly awarded medals to the second batch of Lei Feng's private team of the "loving original mountain".
In the past 20 years, the "Caring Original Mountain" has written human love with practical actions, and the original mountain forest farm has successively taken over and escrowped five difficult public institutions, and has directly resettled nearly 1,000 employees.
In the face of every major disaster, the original mountain people spontaneously organized donations of donations and extended a helping hand to the society.
Sun Jianbo, secretary of the party committee of the former mountain forest farm, said that the spirit of Lei Feng inherits the truth, goodness and beauty of the times, which is a long-term cause in line with the socialist value system.
At the end of the ceremony, the participants visited the Shandong Yuanshan Hard Entrepreneurship Memorial Hall and experienced the construction of barrier-free facilities.
The mayor of Rivas, Wilfredo López, said at the teacher’s training site that the Nicaraguan government agencies are working together to advance the environmental management plan and carry out tree-planting activities together with the HKND Group.
As the developer of the canal project, the HKND Group always adheres to the best international practice of building the canal in accordance with international standards to maximize the protection of Nicaragua's ecological environment.”
Through the combination of theory and practice, university students have led primary and secondary school students to plant trees together to educate the next generation in Nicaragua on how to green the environment.
Francisco Reyes, a professor in the Department of Natural Resources and the Environment at the National Agricultural University of Nicaragua, participated in the afforestation education project.
“We have reason to believe that the Trans-ocean Grand Canal project, also led by the HKND Group, will bring even more benefits to the Nicaraguan people and create more local employment opportunities.”
In order to ensure the long-term effects of afforestation, the HKND Group has also produced an afforestation training catalogue, which was distributed to all 15,000 primary and secondary school students in Rivas Province, aiming to provide long-term technical guidance to teachers, students and parents.
Recently, the 10th China International Folk Art Festival, sponsored by the Chinese Literature Federation and the Qinghai Provincial Government, kicked off in Xining, Qinghai.
About more than 300 artists from 13 countries and regions on the five continents gathered together, bringing wonderful performances with extremely international and national folk characteristics to the audience.
On the 11th, Tajikistan's "Avesta" news agency quoted Tajikistan's central bank as saying that the inflation rate in Tajikistan in the first seven months of this year was 3.7%.
In the first seven months of this year, the country’s inflation rate was 3.7% in the first seven months of this year, including 0.6% in July, compared with 6% in nearly a year.
According to the report, the government's goal is to limit the annual inflation rate in 2016 to the level of 7.5%, compared with 5.1% in 2015.
In addition, the report also pointed out that there are some differences between the Tajik government's expectations for economic development and inflation in 2016 and some major international financial institutions.
According to the forecast of the Ministry of Trade and Economic and Economic Development, the economic growth of the country will reach 7% in 2016, and the country's inflation is basically above this level.
The Asian Development Bank (ADB), the World Bank and the International Monetary Fund have made different predictions about the country’s economic development and inflationary waters in 2016.
For these two indicators, the Asian Development Bank forecast 4.2% and 7%, the World Bank forecast 4.8% and 7.5%, and the International Monetary Fund forecast 3.4% and 8.2%.
It is reported that despite a series of unfavorable external factors such as the sluggishness of the international economy, the devaluation of the Russian ruble and the reduction of remittances, the Tajik country's economy achieved a growth rate of 6% in 2015.
On August 11, the reporter's telephone interview with Huang Yilin, who had returned to his home in Mianyang, Sichuan, said: "At that time, the situation was too urgent, and I had only one thought in my heart to save people!"
Huang Yilin is a 2015 class student of Zhongnan Linke University School of Scenic Gardens.
Huang Yilin, who studied urban-rural planning, would like to visit and study the local architectural design in Sichuan, so the family went on a tour.
At about 10 a.m. on August 8, Huang Yilin's father rested in the hotel, and the mother and daughter came out to visit the ancient city.
It wasn't too far away when I suddenly saw a group of people screaming and walking forward out of curiosity.
Seeing that "the little boy has disappeared, the little girl in the water, only her small head is exposed on the side of the river, sinking from time to time," Huang Yilin, who had learned to swim as a child, jumped down in a hurry to save people.
After going into the water, the height of 165 centimeters Huang Yilin found that she couldn't step on it!
It seemed to be a calm water before, but below it was a torrent!
But she swam desperately toward the little girl.
Huang Yilin said that turbidity and hurry, less than 5 meters away, almost all of her strength.
She did her best to push the little girl to the edge of the embankment: "The slope is particularly slippery, and I'm afraid I'm going to sink without strength."
Therefore, Huang Yilin asked his mother for help, heard her daughter's call for help, Ms. Yin, who was not well-hydrated, was ready to go into the water for rescue and was stopped by the tourists next to him.
On August 10th, after Huang Yilin jumped from the river to save people, Ms. Yin received a lot of condolences and praise from relatives and friends at the same time, but also a lot of relatives and friends "accountability".
To be honest, when the child can't persist on the embankment and ask me for help, my heart is almost broken."
Ms. Yin said sadly, although it is very dangerous, but if she is in such a scene again, she will still support her daughter's choice, she is proud of her daughter!
Because he was forced, Huang Yilin rarely took the initiative to go into the water after learning to swim, "I didn't expect this skill to really come in handy."
According to the class leader of Huang Yilin's class, Huang Yilin is recognized as a "student leader" in the class, and helpful.
The opening ceremony of the first Youth Olympic Games in Yunnan Province on the 13th played the national card to show the vitality of youth.
The first youth games in Yunnan Province will be held from August 13th to August 22nd in Mang City, Dehongzhou.
On August 12, the organizing committee held a press conference to introduce the organization of the competition and the preparations for the opening ceremony.
The first youth games in Yunnan Province were hosted by the Yunnan Provincial Sports Bureau and hosted by the People's Municipal People's Government, and the opening ceremony will be held on the morning of the 13th.
The competition has a total of track and field, football, basketball, tennis, volleyball, weightlifting, cycling, wrestling, gymnastics, martial arts and other 11 projects, involving 180 minor competitions.
Chang Lin, deputy director of the organizing committee of the first Youth Olympic Games in Yunnan Province and deputy director of the Provincial Sports Bureau, said that around the principle of "government-led, market-operated and frugal-run competitions", at present, the preparatory work has been all put in place.
Renovation work has been completed in Dehong Prefecture's Old Sports Association Weightlifting Hall and Martial Arts Hall, a small wrestling hall in Mang City, and a mountain biking track in Yingta Scenic Area have been completed.
In terms of event protection, 580 volunteers are currently recruited, and during the competition, these volunteers will provide enthusiastic services to athletes and spectators in various arenas.
At the same time, 70 medical personnel and 11 ambulances were drawn from hospitals in Dehong Prefecture to form 11 medical teams, which are responsible for the medical protection of the competition site and the accommodation of the athletes.
When it comes to the opening and closing ceremonies, the ignition ceremony of this year's Youth Universiade combines the characteristics of the traditional movements of Yunnan ethnic minorities and will show rich Yunnan cultural connotations.
At present, in order to prepare for the opening ceremony, a total of more than 2,000 students and other professional actors of Dehong Vocational College have been transferred.
The opening and closing ceremony will be fully integrated into the Yunnan elements and Dehong characteristics, showing the characteristics of the regional culture and folklore customs of Mang City in Dehongzhou.
At present, the rehearsal work of the opening ceremony has been completed, and an official performance will be held tomorrow morning.
This year’s Youth Games will be on a larger scale than in the past.
From September 1, elderly people between the ages of 60 and 64 will be able to take the bus in the urban area at half price.
On the morning of the 11th, Jining bus company IC card sales center, several elderly people are queuing in front of the card window, 62-year-old Mr. Yao got an elderly half-price card.
Previously, the Jining Municipal Aging Commission, the Municipal Finance Bureau and the Municipal Transportation Bureau issued the "Notice on the Half Price of 60-64 Seniors Taking Urban Buses", and the preferential policy was officially implemented from September 1st this year.
"Eligible elderly, holding a second-generation identity card to the IC sales center can be processed; foreign accounts in accordance with this age of the elderly also enjoy this discount."
Liu Xia, deputy director of the Jining bus company's computer center, said that more than 200 elderly half-price cards have been held since August 1.
At present, there are two kinds of geriatric cards, one of which is an old free card, and the other is an elderly half-price card.
“In order to facilitate the elderly, the system has been upgraded, and the old free card has been reduced from the original twice a year to once, and the elderly who hold the card do not have to run two times.”
According to the SFC's official micro-blog news, the CSRC said today that at present, the securities regulatory authorities of the two places, as well as between the Shenzhen Stock Exchange and the Hong Kong Stock Exchange, are working closely together.
At the same time, the CSRC has set up a special working group on "Shenzhen-Hong Kong Stock Connect" to actively promote the preparations for the "Shenzhen-Hong Kong Stock Connect", after the relevant regulatory rules and technical equipment are ready, the opportunity will be opened this year.
The number of crowd-supplied text messages has reached a certain number, even if there is no fraud, it can also deal with the crime of fraud.
The People's Court of Woolong District of Nanyang City, Henan Province found that from September 30 to October 4, 2015, the defendant Li Huiwang successively used pseudo base station equipment to send fraudulent information in Tongbai County and Nanyang City.
In the same year, at about 10 o'clock on October 5, the defendant was arrested by the public security police when he once again came to a hotel room in Woolong District of Nanyang City to use fake base stations to send fraudulent text messages.
According to the evaluation, the pseudo base station equipment sent 62,228 text messages on October 4, 2015, resulting in 62,228 mobile phone users interrupted communication per capita for more than 8 seconds to less than 10 minutes.
After the trial, the court found that the defendant Li Huiwang used a pseudo base station to send a total of 62,228 fraudulent text messages to unspecified people, and its behavior has constituted the crime of fraud.
It is recommended that the defender's opinion that the defendant is an attempted offender and did not cause the consequences when he was arrested, and it is recommended that he adopt the opinion of the lighter punishment.
Taking into account the nature of the criminal nature and the attitude of the confession of the defendant, he was sentenced to four years and six months in prison for the crime of fraud, and a fine of 10,000 yuan was fined.
It is currently listed as an Endangered (EN) species on the International Union for Conservation of Nature’s (IUCN) Red List of Endangered Species.
According to the Forestry Department of Jilin Province, in 1998, the joint monitoring data between China and Russia and other countries showed that there were only 4 to 6 wild northeastern tigers in Jilin Province and 3 to 5 northeastern leopards.
According to Changchun, director of the protection department of the forestry department of Jilin Province, in recent years, Jilin Province has continuously increased the protection of wild animals, and the populations of northeast tigers and northeastern leopards in China are increasing significantly, and the distribution area continues to expand.
The latest monitoring data in 2015 showed that only 27 wild northeastern tigers and 42 north-eastern leopards were monitored in Jilin Province alone.
As the world's flagship species for wildlife protection distributed in the border area between China and Russia, the cooperation between the two countries is of great significance to the population recovery and reproduction of wild northeastern tigers and leopards.
According to the Forestry Department of Jilin Province, Jilin Province has previously established a long-term and stable cooperation and exchange mechanism with Russia.
At the 2016 China Haochun Tiger and Leopard Protection International Forum, which ended on the 11th, the forestry departments and animal protection organizations of the two countries once again reached a number of consensuses.
The forestry department of Jilin Province said that strengthening cooperation in the protection of tigers and leopards between China and Russia is not only a very urgent task facing the protection of tigers and leopards in northeastern China, but also a top priority to maintain the health of Russian tigers and leopard populations.
