Judging from the reports of the current Olympic Games, various media have made great changes in communication methods, product forms, language styles, news perspectives and many other aspects than in the past.
The International Olympic Committee and media practitioners from all over the world seem to be ready to meet this round of challenges.
On August 11, Everbright's H-share public offering entered its final day. It is reported that the market reaction in the first two days of the prospectus was uneven. According to the plan, it will be listed on the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on August 18.
